      "en": "Moses did so. As the LORD commanded him, so he did.",
      "ko": "모세가 곧 그 같이 하되 여호와께서 자기에게 명하신대로 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e5ab0e58aaa2d37f848693f1e4caaadb43ce1ac1f471e17db5b6289a035f4bae",
      "translation_text_hash": "bd6512c7929c1c2c5253c93278d859a0c8bbeddac7a8f65bcaa474d357b6309f",
